ulating mirrors to blind her  enemies at just the right moment the  first time we really see her use those  powers is a beautiful moment in Deadpool  2 cars somersault and explosions erupt  around her as she nonchalantly escapes  arm-like final destination in Reverse  she defies odds in breathtaking fashion  worst and underutilized supporting cast  most of the first movie side characters  returned for Deadpool - and they were  joined by a ton of newcomers the scope  is larger yet Deadpool - runs just 11  minutes longer than its 2016 predecessor  with so many characters vying for screen  time something had to get Morena  Baccarin vanessa is the most obvious  oversight her romance with Wade was  intrical - Deadpool in the sequel  Vanessa is shot right at the beginning  making her little more than Wade's  off-screen motivation reactions to test  screenings saw her role is wasted and  it's hard to disagree after watching the  final cut  best hilarious cameos Deadpool's meta  humour is primed for scene stealing  cameos in the first movie stanley  appeared as a strip club DJ and deadpool  wore a printout of hugh jackman's face  as a mask in case the other Deadpool -  raised the bar with a host of hilarious  appearances from familiar faces old  footage of Jackman appears in a callback  to x-men origins Wolverine but that's  nothing compared to the rest  Deadpool's low-budget relative to the  rest of the x-men movies has been a  running self-aware joke wait out here ok  it's a big house it's funny that I only  ever see two of you it's almost like the  studio couldn't afford another x-man in  Deadpool 2 Wade finds himself back at  the x-mansion after being saved by  colossus as he again rants about the  lack of x-men Professor Xavier  Quicksilver Nightcrawler storm Cyclops  and beast appear in a room behind him a  Hollywood a-lister makes an appearance -  after colliding with a power cable  during the botched x-force mission  vanishes invisibility cuts out and the  audience 